{"version":1,"content":"<p>很多人喜歡周日瞓到自然醒，晏起身才來個Hea Brunch，難得一天放慢步調來享受假日。</p><p>坊間不少酒店餐廳及食府於星期天推出高質素主題早午餐，讓識飲識歎的食饕慢慢揀、盡情享受！</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;海鮮控大愛之選&lt;br/&gt;若想趁假</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T06:23:57.418046+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T06:00:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T06:18:08.950739+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T06:18:08.950739+00:00","content_hash":"c9b2bdf9ca90aff7a089be42c85b1992c837df6d7b0747fa803f0710f742fdce","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}